Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:25.80,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:40.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:46.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:52.90,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:57.91,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:04.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:10.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:14.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:17.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:23.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.77,0:02:26.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:29.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:34.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:40.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}面向未來　擁抱夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:28.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}下定決心　仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:34.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}用我的翅膀跨越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:38.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}你才是我命中注定之人 !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:42.55,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}我宣布　絕對love !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.55,0:22:48.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}閃亮的季節漸漸逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:53.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}紀念照裡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:57.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}是那一成不變的　困惑的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.72,0:23:04.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}溫柔地　溫暖地　讓我淚水盈眶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:08.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}預感明天也能在此相見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.73,0:23:12.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}不需要約定　去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:16.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}像往常一樣若無其事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.24,0:23:21.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}笑著揮動小手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:27.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}{\fad(0,1000)}「那麼…明天見。」
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明石薰  野上葵  三宮紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L的特殊超能力者  LV7的THE CHILDREN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解除我們黑色幽靈的洗腦的能力增幅
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是讓人感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要調查嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.82,0:00:47.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:56.74,zhushi-2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}中東  柯美利亞軍屯駐地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:01:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  是黑色幽靈發來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「任務幸苦了  下一個遊樂場是日本」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.03,0:01:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「好好玩耍吧」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個國家好像有好玩的玩具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就想去看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(640,540)\fad(500,500)}42nd  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(780,570)\fad(500,500)}「合體問題！天馬行空的托伊」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  就此離別了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我一定會回來哦  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信你  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真小題大作啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你要快點回來哦  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在天國等你…不對  GoodBye！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明晚上就會回來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  走吧  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那再見了  兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到富士的開發研究部？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  要檢查薰的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.43,0:03:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是為防萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為防萬一？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.45,0:03:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海底隧道發生事故
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要求出動特殊超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:44.70,zhushi-2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}靜岡縣  B.A.B.E.L研究設施
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解了什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛！  你做什麼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為難得兩人獨處嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要不要去告訴小葵和紫穗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰的身體沒有任何問題
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你了  賢木
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過為什麼突然要做檢查啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在使用三倍增幅之後  為了調查有沒有什麼影響
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們檢查了限制器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果發現裝置的心臟部分  蕾雅石的結晶裝置產生了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以為防萬一…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就結束了  你就一邊看雜誌一邊等會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木  給我看一下病歷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為限制器的結晶產生了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反應變得比原先設計的要好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用這個新結晶\N說不定各式各樣的超能力者都能進行聯合的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那不會太過危險嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她正是超能力者的救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為普通人的你則是在協助女王的誕生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美姐姐的乳房又變大了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓人受不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不要全盤接受兵部所說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  這可真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大艦隊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  檢查結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.34,0:05:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們和直美一起出動了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加上不許偷跑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好啊  你們關係這麼親密
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要隊友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:05:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  執行任務的時候不要發私人郵件
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐姿也要端莊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有  你們的主任也很讓我羨慕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把他推下去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還好沒有傷亡人士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.62,0:06:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面的情況怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之要先滅火
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的大火會把直美的柔嫩肌膚烤焦的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說什麼柔嫩肌膚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨大機器人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就是The Children？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說你們有好玩的玩具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是從黑色幽靈那聽來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說在前頭  我的玩具是很強的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了  馬上趕過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是黑色幽靈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  你不在的話就沒辦法解除敵人的洗腦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能力增幅需要Children三人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一擊就將我無法破壞的洗腦給解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並不只是聚集同伴的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是本能地合成新的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將超能力者聚集起來保護
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這便是她真正的形態
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須快點去解除洗腦把他救出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上囉  唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,King…不  God
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,God消防機器人MK-Ⅱ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能會有那麼亂七八糟的機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定不是CG就是幻覺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你說我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是同時使用了催眠和念動力的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用空間認識來看的話  會發現只是車浮在空中而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要太小看我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:27.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樣…樣子變得更加像機器人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連超感覺也混亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的代號是蒂姆·托伊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能力的關鍵字是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有這個形象在  我就是無敵的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.45,0:08:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以內心要堅定！那就不會被區區幻覺給迷惑的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明沒被光線擊中…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的內心最弱了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢把我的朋友給…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我從那裡出來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷崎先生可以不管  但是要將紫穗復原！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有防護罩在  你的攻擊是不起作用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會被你欺騙的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西其實是不存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的  小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光靠氣勢是沒辦法擊退他的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在很生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西只要不去相信就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我也來點物理攻擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,God導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被這擊中的話  你也會變成玩具的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腦子裡很明白  但是身體卻使不上力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想點辦法啊  直美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不甘心  好火大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…有點可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣Children就只剩你一人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擺架子了  快把那個使出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個打倒巴雷特的奇怪的招數
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我當成小薰了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把直美當成…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為三人一起出動的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他似乎沒有察覺到是直美和她們的混編隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的目的恐怕是能力增幅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色幽靈可能在觀察戰況
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！他是故意不給予致命一擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美的真實身份如果穿幫的話那就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從葵和紫穗那也能奪取限制器的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不這樣做是因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生  還要多久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不要自己飛過去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到達之後如果力量減半的話  那就沒意義了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種程度的念動力怎麼可能贏我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直美
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點使出來啊  那個叫什麼能力增幅的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蕾見管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天可是醒過來了的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人啊  跟你沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要妨礙我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能不管嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}イノシシ鍋はぼたん鍋っていうのよ{\r}\N豬肉火鍋叫做牡丹鍋哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}寄ってけよ　茶出すぜ寄{\r}\N來吧  我請你喝茶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人啊  跟你沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要妨礙我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.75,0:11:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  殺了我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下得了手的話那就來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這遊戲就是這樣玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去  葵和紫穗會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:12:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這孩子連內心深處都被黑色幽靈侵蝕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的力量不足以解救他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰來不及的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  要保護她們倆就只能這樣做了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來這次救生艇的限載人數不夠多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  婆婆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該還有其他什麼方法的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外就沒有其他方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動  破壞女王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(698,660)}Queen of Catastrophy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄這孩子就等於是放棄未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能有那樣的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.28,0:12:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永別了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請放開你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒那孩子就等於是幫了黑色幽靈一把
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們為了超能力者和普通人的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是絕對不能向黑色幽靈屈服的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著擔心我們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.47,0:13:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那之前  我們會保護好自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們在扭曲空間  扭轉光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們想抑制住催眠的效果嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要亂來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆的生命機能都很虛弱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這樣做最多只能堅持五六分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題  薰馬上就會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這就來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尋求支援啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不認為這個方向正好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  你也學壞了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.31,0:13:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候沒辦法支援她們的話  那我們還有什麼意義啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有取得許可的空閒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等著寫檢討書吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是敵方還是己方  我們都會救下來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員齊心合力就一定能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  大家都太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  不進行能力增幅嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼不認真來打倒我的話  你們就慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,損害被修復了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來就是幻覺嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之爭取時間直到小薰來為止
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們嘀嘀咕咕地說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我更認真點玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對準機器人的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要輸給那種過時的進口機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  不要小看God消防機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在日本  這麼遜的玩具只有幼兒才會玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.35,0:14:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我國的玩具是非常進步的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:46.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,1/6直美強化服  原型製作  九具津隆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前讓九具津君幫我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要做些奇怪的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光芒和聲音都進不來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婆婆和直美都在奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過谷崎先生在拖後腿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是強力的幻覺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使看不到了  也仍舊在擴散
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到達心臟的話那就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  我快灰心喪氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油  小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在小薰到達之前  我們被幹掉的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼以後就是小薰的天下了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夕陽真美啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們倆還活著吧  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  活在我們心中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要變得幸福啊  連她們倆的份一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我會好好愛你的  連她們倆的份一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常火大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以讓那傢伙一個人享盡好處啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她該不會是故意來遲的吧！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人的友情…真微妙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們倆差不多到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然還是要將那孩子給…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為計程車拒載而費了我不少工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔  這個機體借我一用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你要做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她那個要有型的多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我接下這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下光寫檢討書恐怕是無法了事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  我的God消防機器人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.74,0:16:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  沒能和你們在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  梅洛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼輕易地坦白了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還打算等會打小報告的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.24,0:16:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然敢把我的隊友變成玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  我剛剛是不是說的很妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很妙很妙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:55.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這三人是The Children的全部成員
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！  少扯謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般來說都是主要角色先出公仔的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.51,0:17:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公仔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢貨  最近是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了  閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  怎樣都無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之快點進行能力增幅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你不說  我們也會這麼做的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這孩子背後的團伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有在聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們以為拿到增幅器就能天下無敵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說你們害怕全世界的超能力者齊心協力起來？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不管你派來多少名洗腦超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都會將他們解放的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記住了  年輕人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴蒂姆可以結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  黑色幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  好有型
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是感嘆的時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上囉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  要逃跑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  是要脫離你的影響範圍讓兩人恢復原樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會放跑你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.03,0:18:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真美  下來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用ECM來制止住他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人真可靠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與我的主任簡直是天壤之別
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了  有什麼關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別以為靠那種東西就能制止我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢復了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children三倍增幅完全解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要和誰親吻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可曾記得愛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河在呼喚我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Highway To The Danger Zone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,YF  十歲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:18:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過反正這個遊戲的劇本不是你們使用增幅器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我被幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎樣我都不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是白痴嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你從一開始就一直孤身一人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管有多少玩具  只有一個人玩的話那也很無聊的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才會戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是為何而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了那些把你當成棄卒的傢伙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎樣都不會輸的是我們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們不管遇上什麼事情
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不是孤身一人的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.63,0:19:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才明明都快哭出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真敢說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.42,0:19:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴  閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  你也一定能和我們成為朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過首先要替葵和紫穗報仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用…用踢的也奏效嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.27,0:20:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要心中包含想要拯救對方的心意…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她是沒有的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得太過火了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得太過火的人是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍不注意就偷腥？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然對女高中生出手  你這臭Loli控
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼也…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那三人的羈絆是很特別的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  羈絆嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有點讓我嫉妒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木弟弟火冒三丈了哦  少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  撤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.57,0:20:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不管你派來多少名洗腦超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們都會將他們解放出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹嘛笑嘻嘻的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又以薰她們為對象在想什麼下流的事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼叫又啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:20:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這胖嘟嘟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰是胖嘟嘟啊  靠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木弟弟說的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感情太激烈了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在專心操縱輸送機
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有聽到皆本二尉的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型戰鬥機的搶奪是皆本二尉的獨斷專行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.79,0:21:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我無關
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賢木！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  戰鬥機的費用就由這傢伙用身體來償還
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為那個一架值多少錢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那個情況下是迫不得已的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題的  皆本很堅強的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能做一百億份的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請起來啊  管理官
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,友情和羈絆之類的東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是現實啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本光一  因為一百億的負債
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.19,0:21:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成為政府的所有物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.15,0:21:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就一輩子在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把別人的人生當成玩具來玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  這句話我剛才也說了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:21:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在說俏皮話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說  為什麼玩具是俏皮話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麼也不知道就說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.69,0:23:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.61,0:23:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…凱莉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  不過我很想見你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  這女人是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生你真齷齪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.03,0:23:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來這不是一件小事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和…和小孩子沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.35,0:23:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.57,0:23:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:24:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第43話  「天作之合！卡羅琳、命運的重逢」
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.87,0:24:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光一  等我成為大人之後
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我再長大一點之後
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和我結婚嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.26,0:24:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

